⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
253 calories 23g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins included)

Frosted Animal Cookie Protein Blizzard 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book

Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 145 recipes like this one!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40g Monk Fruit Sweetener (or any sugar substitute)
- 3g (½ tsp) cake batter extract
- 2.5g (½ tsp) vanilla bean paste (or extract)
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Mix-ins:
- 24g frosted animal cookies
253 cal 27g C, 5g F, 23g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 24 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if necessary
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the cookies
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle

